    "title": "Portland Trail Blazers Team Payroll | Basketball-Reference.com",
    "text": "Jrue HolidayTraded from BOS to POR July 7, 2025. Signed 4-yr/$135M contract extension April 11, 2024. Jerami Grant2027-28 is a player option. Signed 5-yr/$160M contract July 9, 2023. Deni AvdijaTraded from WAS to POR July 6, 2024. Signed 4-yr/$55M contract extension October 23, 2023. Damian Lillard2027-28 is a player option. Signed 3-yr/$41M contract July 19, 2025. Robert WilliamsTraded from BOS to POR October 1, 2023. Signed 4-yr/$48M contract extension August 24, 2021. Matisse ThybulleExercised player option June 24, 2025. 2025-26 is a player option. Signed 3-yr/$33M contract July 7, 2023. Scoot HendersonOption exercised October 21, 2025. Option exercised October 19, 2024. 2025-26 and 2026-27 are team options. Signed 4-yr/$44M rookie scale contract July 1, 2023. Shaedon SharpeSigned extension October 20, 2025. Option exercised October 19, 2024. Option exercised October 10, 2023. 2024-25 and 2025-26 are team options. Signed rookie scale contract on July 1, 2022. Donovan ClinganOption exercised October 21, 2025. 2026-27 and 2027-28 are team options. Signed rookie scale contract on July 4, 2024. Yang Hansen2027-28 and 2028-29 are team options. Signed rookie scale contract on July 1, 2025. Kris MurrayOption exercised October 21, 2025. Option exercised October 19, 2024. 2025-26 and 2026-27 are team options. Signed 4-yr/$14M rookie scale contract July 1, 2023. Vít KrejčíTraded from ATL to POR February 1, 2026. 2027-28 is a team option. Signed 4-yr/$10.2M contract July 12, 2024. Blake WesleySigned 1-yr contract July 21, 2025. Toumani CamaraSigned extension October 19, 2025. Traded from PHO to POR September 27, 2023. Signed 4-yr/$7.6M entry level contract July 3, 2023. Sidy CissokoSigned 2-yr contract February 20, 2026. Caleb LoveSigned two-way contract July 1, 2025. Jayson KentSigned two-way contract March 3, 2026. Chris YoungbloodSigned two-way contract March 3, 2026. Deandre AytonWaived June 29, 2025. Traded from PHO to POR September 27, 2023. Signed 4-yr/$133M contract July 15, 2022. Rayan RupertWaived February 20, 2026. Option exercised June 28, 2025. 2025-26 is a team option. Signed 3-yr/$5M contract July 4, 2023. Didi LouzadaWaived August 29, 2022 with stretch provision. Traded from NOP to POR February 8, 2022. 2023-24 and 2024-25 are not guaranteed. Signed 4-yr/$7.7M contract August 13, 2021. Sidy CissokoConverted to standard contract February 20, 2026. Signed two-way contract February 8, 2025. Javonte CookeEnded March 2, 2026. Signed two-way contract October 20, 2025.",
